  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Cultural Relations Platform - This action will enable the EU to address short and medium-term foreign policy needs and opportunities by supporting innovative policies/initiatives and by deepening EU relations and dialogues, forging alliances and partnerships, by supporting EU SMEs willingEuropean operators to engage in tradego about their business with third countries subject to in full compliance with EU sanctions, fostering increasedstrengthening the role forof culture in EU&apos;sUnion&#xbf;s external relations and by fosterfostering independent and pluralistic media, access to information and the fight against disinformation.</narrative>
  </description>
